<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Optus cuts Australia international call rates.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Optus cuts Australia international call rates.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optus Communications Pty Ltd said it would cut its long distance rates by up to 10 percent, effective September 13 to four key destinations -- Canada, Hong Kong, Singapore and the United States.</p>
<p>Optus said the rates for off peak calls are 84 Australian cents per minute to Canada and the U.S. and 78 cents per minute to Hong Kong and Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
